y:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">E</span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">xecuti</span><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">v</span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">e Committee.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div id="ib3754da614884ac984148a0a23cde0b6_58"></div><div><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Board and Committee Self-Assessments</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:18.7pt"><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">E</span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">ach </span><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">y</span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">ear</span><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">, </span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">the Board </span><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">a</span><span style="color:#141414;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">nd the </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Board&#8217;s</span><span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font