style="margin-top:8pt;text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" id="f-52" escape="true"><div style="margin-top:8pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1) The CEO for each year is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="ecd:PeoName" id="f-53">Daniel Chard</ix:nonNumeric>. The Other Named Executive Officers for each year are as follows:</span></div><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2021: Messrs. James Maloney, Nicholas Johnson, Anthony Tyree, and Ms. Lauren Walker.</span></div><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2022: Messrs. James Maloney, Nicholas Johnson, Anthony Tyree, and Jason Groves.</span></div><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2023: Messrs. James Maloney, Nicholas Johnson, Anthony Tyree, and Jason Groves.</span></div><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2024: Messrs. James Maloney, Nicholas Johnson, Anthony Tyree, and Jason Groves.</span></div><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2025: Messrs. James Maloney, Nicholas Johnson, Anthony Tyree, and Jason Groves.</span></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:13.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-13.5pt"><span style="color:#0000